  "scope": "Layers one through four, plus canonical 256-bit integer and 32-byte encodings for both Pasta fields in both representation states, exact byte round trips, field-value round trips, canonical parity, primality of both compiled Pasta moduli, forward and inverse roots of unity with exact orders and lookup bounds, both compiled square-root exponentiation schedules, and the extracted generic Tonelli-Shanks routines under explicit field-operation and root-callback contracts. Those contracts still need to be connected to the concrete Fp/Fq square-root entry points. Inversion and public square-root methods, reducing encodings of wider byte strings, product accumulation, and other subsystems remain unproved.",
